      "id": "decision-2",
      "question": "The refine phase has completed. Please review the analysis and approve to continue, or provide feedback to request changes.",
      "context": "**Warning**: No analysis draft was found on the work branch. The agent may not have written the output to the expected path.",
      "options": [
